<h1>PERMANENT EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT</h1>
<p><strong>BETWEEN THE UNDERSIGNED:</strong></p>
<p>The company <strong>{{company.name}}</strong>, whose head office is located at <strong>{{company.address}}</strong>, hereinafter referred to as "The Employer".</p>
<p><strong>AND:</strong></p>
<p>Mr./Ms. <strong>{{employee.fullName}}</strong>, holder of national ID <strong>{{employee.cin}}</strong>, residing at <strong>{{employee.address}}</strong>, hereinafter referred to as "The Employee".</p>

<h2>ARTICLE 1: ENGAGEMENT</h2>
<p>The Employer engages the Employee under a permanent employment contract starting from <strong>{{formatDate employee.hireDate}}</strong>.</p>

<h2>ARTICLE 2: DUTIES AND QUALIFICATION</h2>
<p>The Employee will perform the duties of <strong>{{employee.function}}</strong> within the <strong>{{employee.department}}</strong> department.</p>

<h2>ARTICLE 3: REMUNERATION</h2>
<p>In exchange for their services, the Employee will receive a monthly gross salary of <strong>{{formatCurrency employee.salary}}</strong>.</p>


